  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| style-loader | devDependencies | minor | `0.20.3` -> `0.23.1` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webpack-contrib/style-loader</summary>\n\n### [`v0.23.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0231httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0230v0231-2018-10-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.23.0...v0.23.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **addStyles:** support exports of transpiled transforms (`options.transform`) ([#&#8203;333](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/333)) ([33aebed](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/33aebed))\n\n### [`v0.23.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0230httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0221v0230-2018-08-27)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.22.1...v0.23.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **useable:** add `insertInto` support (`options.insertInto`) ([#&#8203;341](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/341)) ([2588aca](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/2588aca))\n\n#### [0.22.1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.22.0...v0.22.1) (2018-08-08)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **addStyles:** use `var` instead of `const` (IE fix) ([#&#8203;338](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/338)) ([1ca12ab](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/1ca12ab))\n\n### [`v0.22.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0230httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0221v0230-2018-08-27)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.22.0...v0.22.1)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **useable:** add `insertInto` support (`options.insertInto`) ([#&#8203;341](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/341)) ([2588aca](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/2588aca))\n\n#### [0.22.1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.22.0...v0.22.1) (2018-08-08)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **addStyles:** use `var` instead of `const` (IE fix) ([#&#8203;338](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/338)) ([1ca12ab](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/1ca12ab))\n\n### [`v0.22.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0220httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0210v0220-2018-08-07)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.21.0...v0.22.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   insertInto and insertAt collaboration ([#&#8203;325](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/325)) ([c7d8fec](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/c7d8fec))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   add support for **webpack_nonce** ([#&#8203;319](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/319)) ([fc24512](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/fc24512))\n\n### [`v0.21.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0220httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0210v0220-2018-08-07)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/compare/v0.20.3...v0.21.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   insertInto and insertAt collaboration ([#&#8203;325](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/325)) ([c7d8fec](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/c7d8fec))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   add support for **webpack_nonce** ([#&#8203;319](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/319)) ([fc24512](https://renovatebot.com/gh/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/fc24512))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
